        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>If the bulette jumps at least 15 feet as part of its movement, it can then use this action to land on its feet in a space that contains one or more other creatures. Each of those creatures must succeed on a [[/save ability=str dc=16]] or Dexterity saving throw (target's choice) or be knocked &amp;Reference[condition=prone] and take 14 ([[/damage 3d6 + 4 type=bludgeoning]]) damage plus 14 ([[/damage 3d6 + 4 type=slashing]]) damage. On a successful save, the creature takes only half the damage, isn't knocked &amp;Reference[condition=prone], and is pushed 5 feet out of the bulette's space into an unoccupied space of the creature's choice. If no unoccupied space is within range, the creature instead falls &amp;Reference[condition=prone] in the bulette's space.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
